WEBVTT

00:00:29.038 --> 00:00:31.079
were expecting a solution.

00:00:31.121 --> 00:00:34.996
So I raised funds,
hired engineers from the city

00:00:35.037 --> 00:00:38.537
in order to dig a deep well
and bypass the arsenic

00:00:38.579 --> 00:00:40.871
and provide access to clean water.

00:00:40.912 --> 00:00:42.912
And we celebrated.

00:00:44.204 --> 00:00:49.371
But as I boarded the plane,
I thought, “What if it breaks?”

00:00:50.496 --> 00:00:51.746
I'm an engineer.

00:00:51.787 --> 00:00:54.912
I know that's not if but when.

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:57.454
When the well breaks, who will fix it?

00:00:57.496 --> 00:00:59.121
How will they pay for it?

00:00:59.162 --> 00:01:02.079
And will they even know
there's a problem in the first place?